# 总仓库通过子模块记录九个工程仓库。
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!AD7682/
!Triple 1S Battery Charger/
!QI5W-R-Ver2.0/
!ADS124S08_RTD_Acq/
!STM32F103RCT6最小系统板/
!HookWeightModule/
!QiRec-5-T/
!QiRec-5-R/
!UML244R/

# 工程清单、独立硬件源文件和维护工具纳入总仓库
!.gitmodules
!嵌入式程序与PCB工程清单.xlsx
!INA229功率计.SchDoc
!tools/
!tools/**/
!tools/**/*.md
!tools/**/*.mjs
!tools/**/*.py
!tools/**/*.ps1

# 检查截图、机器路径日志和依赖链接留在本机
tools/**/node_modules/
tools/**/*.png
tools/**/*.ndjson
tools/**/*.json
